error[E1001]: `xs.len` is used here after its value moved away
 --> mem:///main.lu:4:5
  |
2 |     var t = move xs
  |                  -- `xs` moved here
3 |     (mut t).push(9)
4 |     xs.len
  |     ^^^^^^ used after the move
  |
  = note: `xs.len` is part of `xs`; moving one empties the other. Disjoint fields stay usable.
  = note: re-initializing the place (assigning to it) also makes it usable again.
help: to keep the original, copy it at the move
  |
2 |     var t = move copy xs
  |
